return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-28T00:04:13+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-28T00:04:13+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','Multilingual WordPress, one post per language: linked translations of posts, pages, categories, media text, widgets and the site title, with your old Tranzly translations imported.'=>'WordPress ya lugha nyingi, chapisho moja kwa lugha: tafsiri zilizounganishwa za machapisho, kurasa, kategoria, maandishi ya media, wijeti na jina la tovuti, huku tafsiri zako za zamani za Tranzly zikiwa zimeingizwa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Watoa huduma za AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Waundaji wa ChatGPT. Chombo kizuri cha matumizi yote.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Waundaji wa Claude. Wana nguvu katika kuandika na uwezo mkubwa wa kufikiri kwa uangalifu.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Miundo ya Gemini ya Google. Haraka na ya bei nafuu.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kampuni ya Ulaya ya AI yenye miundo ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Mifumo ya bei nafuu ambayo ni mizuri katika uandishi na msimbo.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ufunguo mmoja kwa ajili ya mif modelo kutoka kwa watoa huduma wengi tofauti.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Huduma yoyote inayofanya kazi kama API ya OpenAI, ikiwa ni pamoja na mtindo unaoendesha kwenye kompyuta au seva yako mwenyewe.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Jumla (inatum 것입니다 wakati hakuna kitu maalum zaidi kilichowekwa)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kuandika na kuandika upya','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Code and CSS'=>'Nambari za programu na CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufikia ukurasa huu.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Mipangilio hii inashirikiwa na kila programu-jalizi inayozitumia: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Ufunguo wako umesimbwa kwa njia fiche katika hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumwa tu kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua — kamwe hautumwi kwetu.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Hatua ya 1 ya 2: chagua mtoa huduma wa AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Unaleta ufunguo wako mwenyewe, kwa hiyo unamlipa mtoa huduma moja kwa moja kwa kile unachotumia. Huna uhakika? Yoyote kati ya hizi inafanya kazi vizuri; unaweza kuongeza nyingine baadaye.','Next'=>'Ijayo','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2: unganisha %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako inayolingana na OpenAI, inayomalizika kwa /v1. Ufunguo unahitajika tu ikiwa huduma inaomba mmoja.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fungua %s na uingie (au ufungue akaunti ya bure).','the %s API keys page'=>'ukurasa wa funguo za API za %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Unda ufunguo mpya na uukili.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Bandika hapa chini kisha bonyeza "Hifadhi na ujaribu". Tunatuma ombi moja dogo ili kuangalia kama inafanya kazi.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Watoa huduma wengi wanahitaji mkopo kidogo kwenye akaunti kabla ya ufunguo kufanya kazi: %s.','add credit'=>'ongeza mkopo','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Chagua mtoa huduma mwingine','Address'=>'Anwani','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Ufunguo uliosekana unaishia kwenye …%s — bandika mpya ili kuubadilisha','Key (optional)'=>'Ufunguo (si lazima)','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Save and test'=>'Hifadhi na ujaribu','Providers'=>'Watoa Huduma','Provider'=>'Mtoa Huduma','Status'=>'Hali','Key'=>'Ufunguo','Get a key'=>'Pata ufunguo','Test'=>'Jaribu','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Imesitishwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu jalizi: sasisha programu jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliookolewa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zilibadilika). Weka tena.','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Imeunganishwa — jaribio la mwisho limefaulu %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho limeshindwa: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Imeunganishwa — haijajaribiwa bado','Which model to use'=>'Mtindo gani wa kutumia','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ inaashiria pendekezo letu kwa kazi hiyo. Orodha hiyo inajumuisha kila modeli ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutumia, iliyosomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mtoa huduma.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Inapendekezwa kwa mtoa huduma —','Save models'=>'Hifadhi miundo','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sasisha orodha za miundo kutoka kwa watoa huduma','best quality'=>'ubora bora','lowest cost'=>'gharama ya chini kabisa','fastest'=>'haraka zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza modeli mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Je, modeli imetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili uitumie mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la mtindo','Add model'=>'Ongeza modeli','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya mif modelo iliyopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hiyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi, au uwashe sasisho za kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia angalia Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la upakuaji wa kawaida tu ndilo linalotumikaje: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna kitu kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha hiyo imesainiwa, na orodha ambayo inashindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi hupuuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ilichunguzwa mwisho %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, kisha uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'orododha mpya zaidi imewekwa','already up to date'=>'tayari imesasishwa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'upakuaji umeshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa; orodha ya sasa inabaki ikitumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa funguo za API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma hajulikani.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Nakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Modeli zimehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina halisi la mfano, kwa mfano kama nyaraka za mtoa huduma zinavyoandika.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Imeongezwa %s. Ichague chini ya "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Kielelezo kimeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Sasisho za kila siku zimezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imetezwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI umehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la moja ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Ingiza tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI bado haijasakinishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mfano uliochaguliwa kwa kazi hii. Chagua mmoja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hautumiki na toleo hili la programu-jalizi.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inawezekana kufikiwa kutoka kwa seva yako ya wavuti (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haiwezi kufikiwa kutoka kwa tovuti inayopangishwa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa iko hewani, mwenyeji wako anaweza kuwa anazuia miunganisho ya kutoa, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema akaunti yako haina salio au mgao uliobaki. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako katika akaunti yako nao, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikubali ufunguo wako. Huenda ukaingizwa vibaya, umefutwa au muda wake umekwisha. Unda ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s alikataa ombi hili kwa ufunguo wako. Ufunguo unaweza usiwe na ufikiaji wa mtindo au kipengele hiki, au akaunti yako inahitaji kuthibitishwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Mfano wa "%1$s" haupatikani kutoka kwa %2$s kwa ajili ya ufunguo wako. Chagua mfano mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi modeli ya "%1$s". Chagua modeli nyingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au boresha mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inaweka kiwango cha juu cha jinsi kitufe chako kinavyoweza kutuma maombi kwa kasi gani. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au ongeza kiwango chako cha kikomo cha matumizi nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa (kutapakaa au mzigo mkubwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo na mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo hatukuweza kuitambua. Jaribu tena; likiendelea kutokea, wasiliana na usaidizi ukitumia maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa mfumo ambao programu-jalishi hii haikuweza kusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua mtindo mwingine au wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (Inayooana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo wa mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma haorodheti mtindo wowote wa maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza mtindo wewe mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s alijibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Jukumu lako la mtumiaji haliruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Muulize msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha matumizi ya AI ya kila mwezi. Msimamizi anaweza kukiinua katika mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, vikomo na ruhusa za nafasi hutumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makadirio, zilizokokotwo kutoka kwa bei zilizochapishwa; modeli isiyo na bei inayojulikana inahesabiwa kama sufuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Wakati','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Inayotumika kwa','Model'=>'Mfano','Tokens in / out'=>'Tokeni zinazoingia / zinazotoka','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hakuna maombi ya AI yaliyofanywa bado.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kiwango cha juu cha matumizi ya kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi kukiwa hakuna kikomo. AI husimama kwa mwezi uliosalia mara tu gharama inayokadiriwa inapofikia kiwango hicho.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi ya kila mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha tupu kwa kikomo chochote.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Weka alama yoyote ili kuruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vigezo na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa vimehifadhiwa.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Lugha hiyo si mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti hii.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Tafsiri lazima iwe ya aina sawa ya maudhui kama asili.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya lugha nyingine za tovuti.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Hati za mfumo za skrini ya msimamizi hazipo kwenye nakala hii ya programu-jalizi. Isakinishe upya kutoka kwenye kifurushi kilichotolewa.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Kiambishi awali lazima kiwe na herufi 1 hadi 8 za mwanzoni ndogo au nambari, kianze na herufi, na kisiwe jina la plagi.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" si msimbo wa lugha. Tumia eneo la WordPress kama vile fr_FR au de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Orodhesha angalau lugha moja.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Huruhusiwa kutafsiri kipengele hiki.','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Kipengele hiki tayari kina toleo katika lugha hiyo.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Injini hiyo ya kutafsiri haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini tofauti kwa kila lugha, urejeshaji otomatiki na vikomo vya matumizi ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Kila lugha lazima iwe mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti, ikiwa na injini inayopatikana.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Orodha mbadala inaweza kutaja injini zinazopatikana pekee.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Kikomo cha kila mwezi ni kiasi katika dola za US, sifuri au zaidi, kwa injini inayopatikana.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendwa na mtindo kwa kila lugha ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro. Orodha ya kutotafsiri ni ya bure.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Ingizo za kamusi lazima zipangwa kwa lugha mojawapo ya tovuti.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Sauti huwekwa kwa kila lugha ya tovuti: kiasi cha rasmi kwa chaguo-msingi, zaidi au chini, pamoja na maagizo ya hiari.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Thamani ya %s si mojawapo ya chaguo zinazoruhusiwa.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Foleni ya nyuma haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Kazi ya tafsiri huendeshwa kama mtu anayeianzisha, kwa hivyo mtumiaji lazima awe ameingia kwenye akaunti.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Hakuna chochote unachoruhusiwa kutafsiri katika uteuzi huo.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Bidhaa hiyo si sehemu ya kazi ya utafsiri.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Huruhusiwi kubadilisha tafsiri hiyo.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Kikundi cha bidhaa hii tayari kina toleo la %1$s (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Bidhaa haiwezi kuwa tafsiri yake yenyewe.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Bidhaa hiyo tayari ni tafsiri ya kitu kingine. Kitenganishe kwanza.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Kiungo cha tafsiri kimeshindwa kuhifadhiwa.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Maandishi hayo hayawezi kutafsiriwa hapa.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Maandishi hayo ya media hayawezi kutafsiriwa hapa.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Tafsiri inaweza kuchapishwa au kuwekwa kama rasimu.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuchapisha aina hii ya maudhui.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Kipengele hiki kimeshaandikwa katika lugha hiyo.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Tafsiri hii ilihaririwa na mtu (au kuingizwa kutoka nje), kwa hiyo imelindwa. Ifungue ili uweze kuitafsiri tena.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Hakuna injini ya tafsiri iliyowekwa bado. Ongeza ufunguo wa moja katika Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Injini hiyo ya tafsiri haijasakinishwa bado: ongeza ufunguo wake kwanza.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Maandishi hayo yanatafsiriwa na kazi nyingine kwa sasa; bidhaa hii itatumia jibu hilo.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Hakuna injini ya tafsiri inayoweza kuchukua kipengele hiki.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Injini haikurudisha tafsiri kwa kila sehemu ya kipengele hiki. Hakuna kilichobadilishwa.','AI model'=>'Mtindo wa AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Mfano wa AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa. Jaribu tena hivi punde, au tumia injini nyingine.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia %s. Hakikisha kuwa inaweza kufanya miunganisho ya kutoa data, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako wa API. Angalia ufunguo katika Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Akaunti yako ya %s imemaliza kiwango au salio lake. Iongezee salio, au tumia injini nyingine.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s alituomba tupunguze kasi. Jaribio litafanywa tena kiotomatiki.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Maandishi haya ni marefu sana kwa %s kwa mara moja. Gawanya maudhui, au tumia injini nyingine.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s imekataa kutafsiri maudhui haya. Jaribu injini nyingine, au itafsiri kwa mkono.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s haitafsiri lugha hii. Chagua injini nyingine kwa ajili yake.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi cha mwezi huu kwa ajili ya %s kimefikiwa, kwa hiyo hakuna kingine kilichotumwa huko. Ongeza kikomo katika Tranzly → Engines, au subiri hadi mwezi ujao.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Tafsiri yenye %s imeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo Tranzly haikuweza kutambua. Maelezo yako hapa chini.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kitambulisho cha injini lazima kiwe na herufi ndogo, nambari na vapa.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia uanzishaji usioidhinishwa. Ili kumkabidhi mtumiaji wako leseni hiyo, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako kisha utume tena fomu ya ushirika.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ungependa kuunganisha %1$s katika %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','activate a license here'=>'weka leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kupitia barua pepe mara tu baada ya ununuzi:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Amsha leseni kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Washa leseni kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali liwashe ili uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali nenda kwenye %2$s ili kuiwasha na uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Washa nyongeza hii','Activate %s'=>'Washa %s','Activate %s features'=>'Washa vipengele vya %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kamilisha Uwashaji wa "%s" Sasa','Activate %s Plan'=>'Washa Mpango wa %s','Activated'=>'Imewashwa','Activating'=>'Inawashwa','Activating license'=>'Inawasha leseni','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Akaunti yako imeamilishwa vizuri kwa mpango wa %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Inayotumika','Add another domain'=>'Ongeza kikoa kingine','Add-Ons'=>'Viongezao','Add Ons for %s'=>'Viongezao vya %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Hatukuweza kupakia orodha ya nyongeza. Huenda hili ni tatizo kwa upande wetu, tafadhali jaribu kurudi baada ya dakika chache.','Add-On'=>'Ongezo','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ni nyongeza ya malipo pekee. Lazima ununue leseni kwanza kabla ya kuwasha programu-jalizi hii.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Kyongeza cha %s kimenunuliwa kwa mafanikio.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Mpango wako wa nyongeza wa %s umesasishwa kwa mafanikio.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Jaribio la bure la %s limeghairiwa kwa mafanikio. Kwa kuwa programu-jalizi hii ni ya kulipia pekee, imezimwa kiotomatiki. Ikiwa ungependa kuitumia siku za usoni, utahitaji kununua leseni.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s haiwezi kuendesha bila programu-jalizi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s haiwezi kufanya kazi bila %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Ninakujulisha tu kwamba maelezo ya viongezeo vya %s yanavukwa kutoka kwenye seva ya nje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Visingi vya moduli %s','Address Line %d'=>'Mstari wa Anwani %d','Affiliate'=>'Mshirika','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Kutokana na kukiuka sheria zetu za ushirika, tumeamua kusimamisha kwa muda akaunti yako ya ushirika. Ikiwa una maswali yoyote, tafadhali wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Akaunti yako ya ushirika imesimamishwa kwa muda.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Maombi yako ya ushirika kwa ajili ya %1$s yamekubaliwa! Ingia katika eneo lako la ushirika kupitia: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na programu yetu ya washirika, kwa bahati mbaya, tumeamua kwa sasa kukataa ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya siku 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Asante kwa kutuma maombi yako ya kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, tutakagua maelezo yako katika siku 14 zijazo na tutakurudia na taarifa zaidi.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'kuki ya ufuatiliaji ya %s baada ya ziara ya kwanza ili kuongeza uwezo wa mapato.','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Mara tu leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bure lakini HUTAWA na ufikiaji wa vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Mara tu leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake, hutaweza tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiwezesha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutakuwa na ufikiaji wa usalama wa %2$s na masasisho ya vipengele, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kuboresha.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya %1$s yako ya bure, lipa kiasi kidogo kama %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubali na Kuamilisha Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Nakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina zote','allow'=>'ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Tayari umejiandikisha kushiriki katika ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Umeshajijiandikisha kwenye ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, jambo ambalo linatusaidia kuendelea kuyaboresha.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Ya kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni ya bila kujulikana','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Omba kuwa mshirika','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Idhinisha & Anza Jaribio','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Tafadhali tuambie sababu ili tuweze kuboresha.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia kwa ajili ya kuboresha hapa chini na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia wakati wa ununuzi nasi tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Unganisha na akaunti ya mmiliki wa leseni.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Mwandishi','Invalid module ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha moduli si sahihi.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Huna leseni halali ya kufikia toleo la malipo.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Kusakinisha kiotomatiki hufanya kazi tu kwa watumiaji waliowezesha chaguo hili.','Premium version already active.'=>'Toleo la malipo tayari liko hai.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Toleo la nyongeza la kulipia limesanikishwa tayari.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin ni "Serviceware" jambo ambalo linamaanisha kuwa haina toleo la msimbo la kulipia.','Automatic Installation'=>'Usakinishaji wa Kiotomatiki','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kuzima kiotomatiki baada ya:','Average Rating'=>'Wastani wa Ukadiriaji','Awesome'=>'Nzuri Sana','based on %s'=>'kulingana na %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Kuwa mshirika','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Unapenda %s? Kuwa Balozi wetu na ujipatie pesa taslimu ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Hujambo, je, ulijua kuwa %1$s ina programu ya washirika? Ikiwa unapenda %2$s unaweza kuwa balozi wetu na kupata pesa taslimu!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Bora','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sasisho kwa toleo la Beta litabadilisha toleo lako lililosakinishwa la %s na toleo jipya zaidi la Beta - tumia kwa tahadhari, na wala si kwenye tovuti za uzalishaji. Umeonywa.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Imelipiwa %s','Billing'=>'Malipo','Billing & Invoices'=>'Ankara na Risiti','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Imefungwa','Blocking'=>'Inasimamisha','Blog ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Blogu','Body'=>'Mwili','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ndiyo - anwani zote mbili ni zangu','Bundle'=>'Kifurushi','Bundle Plan'=>'Mpango wa Kifurushi','Business name'=>'Jina la biashara','Buy license'=>'Nunua leseni','Buy a license now'=>'Nunua leseni sasa','Cancel'=>'Ghairi','Cancel Installation'=>'Ghairisha Usakinishaji','Cancel Subscription'=>'Ghairi Usajili','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Iwapo HUPANGI kutumia %1$s hii kwenye tovuti hii (au tovuti nyingine yoyote) - ungependa kusitisha %2$s hiyo pia?','Cancel Trial'=>'Ghairi Jaribio','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Kufuta kipindi cha majaribio kutazuia mara moja ufikiaji wa vipengele vyote vya kulipia. Una uhakika?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Ghairi %s & Endelea','Cancelled'=>'Imetengwa','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Inazima usajili','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Hupati ufunguo wako wa leseni?','Change License'=>'Badilisha Leseni','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Lazima uthibitishe sasisho hili ndani ya saa 4 zijazo. Ikiwa huwezi kupata barua pepe hiyo, tafadhali angalia folda yako ya taka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Mmiliki wa barua pepe lazima athibitishe sasisho hilo ndani ya saa 4 zijazo.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ndiye mmiliki mpya wa akaunti.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Asante kwa kuthibitisha mabadiliko ya umiliki. Barua pepe imetumwa tu kwa %s kwa ajili ya idhinisho la mwisho.','Change Ownership'=>'Badilisha Umiliki','Change Plan'=>'Badilisha Mpango','Change User'=>'Badilisha Mtumiaji','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Kwa kubadilisha mtumiaji, unakubali kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti kwenda kwa:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Orodha ya Mabadiliko','Changing user, please wait'=>'Inabadilisha mtumiaji, tafadhali subiri','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Kama hukupokea barua pepe hiyo, jaribu kuangalia folda yako ya taka au utafute barua pepe kutoka kwa %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Lipa','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Chagua tovuti hadi %s za kuamilisha leseni.','City'=>'Jiji','Clear API Cache'=>'Futa Akiba ya API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Futa Vipindi Vya Sasisho Vinavyopita','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bonyeza hapa','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Bonyeza hapa kutumia programu-jalizi hii bila kutaja jina lako','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Bonyeza ili uone maoni yaliyotoa ukadiriaji wa %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s ndiyo anwani ya barua pepe ya mteja wangu','Code'=>'Msimbo','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Tume %s wakati mteja anaponunua leseni mpya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kwa kuwa tunatenga siku 30 kwa ajili ya uwezekano wa kurejeshewa fedha, tunalipa tu kamisheni ambazo ni za zaidi ya siku 30.','Communication'=>'Mawasiliano','Compatible up to'=>'Inatumika hadi','complete the opt-in'=>'kamilisha kujisajili','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hongera','Never miss an important update'=>'Usikose kamwe sasisho muhimu','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Asante kwa kusasisha hadi %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Jiandikishe ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara, na ili ushiriki maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Jisajili ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya kielimu, na matoleo ya hapa na pale, na ili kushiriki baadhi ya maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukiruka hili, hakuna nishida! %1$s bado itafanya kazi vizuri tu.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeleta chaguo hili ili usipate kukosa sasisho muhimu na kutusaidia kufanya %s iendane vyema na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tuna furaha kuanzisha ujumuishaji wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %s kwenye mtandao ambazo bado zinahitaji umakini wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %d ambazo bado zinasubiri uanzishaji wa leseni.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kutumia %s kwenye tovuti hizo, tafadhali weka ufunguo wako wa leseni hapa chini na ubofye kitufe cha kuwezesha.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Badala yake, unaweza kuiruka kwa sasa na kuwezesha leseni hiyo baadaye, katika ukurasa wa Akaunti ya kiwango cha mtandao wa %s yako.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it