port.'=>'%1$s ili kufikia toleo la %2$s la usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na usaidizi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuweka modi ya beta ya mtumiaji.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuwasha au kuzima hali ya lebo-nyeupe ya leseni.','Annual'=>'Ya mwaka','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", %s hataweza tena kuona jina lako na barua pepe yako.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", data ya uchunguzi haitatum আরও tena kwa %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Kwa kukata muunganisho wa tovuti hii, data za utambuzi zilizoshirikiwa awali kuhusu %1$s zitafutwa na hazitaonekana tena kwa %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Kwa kujiondoa kwenye kushiriki habari hii na seva ya sasisho, utalazimika kuangalia matoleo mapya ya %1$s na kuyapakua na kuyasakinisha kwa mkono. Sio tu usumbufu, lakini kukosa sasisho kunaweza kuhatarisha tovuti yako na kusababisha matatizo ya utangamano yasiyo ya lazima, kwa hiyo tunapendekeza sana kuweka ruhusa hizi muhimu zikiwa zimewashwa.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Ghairi %1$s - Sihitaji tena sasisho zama za usalama na vipengele, wala usaidizi wa %2$s kwa sababu sipangi kutumia %3$s kwenye tovuti 