se windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','like websitesSites'=>'Tovuti','nounPricing'=>'Bei','trial periodTrial'=>'Jaribio','verbOpt In'=>'Jiandikishe','verbOpt Out'=>'Jiondoe','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','verbUpgrade'=>'Boresha','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','Language suggestion'=>'Pendekezo la lugha','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Ukurasa huu unapatikana pia katika %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Iisome katika %s','No thanks'=>'Hapana asante','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Chagua jinsi lugha zinavyoonekana katika anwani zako: folda, kikoa kidogo, kikoa tofauti au kigezo cha hoja.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Matumize ndogo na vikoa tofauti kwa kila lugha ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Folda za lugha lazima ziwe orodha.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" haiwezi kuwa folda ya lugha. Tumia herufi ndogo 2 hadi 12, nambari au vistari, tofauti kwa kila lugha, na si neno ambalo WordPress tayari inatumia.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Domains lazima iwe orodha.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" si jina la kikoa, kama vile example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Kila lugha inahitaji kikoa chake yenyewe.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa lazima yawe orodha.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa lazima yaorodheshwe kwa kila lugha.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s" haiwezi kutumika katika anwani. Tumia herufi ndogo, nambari na vapa.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Mpangilio huu umewashwa au umezimwa.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Kuficha kurasa ambazo hazijataf