ariri','Floating switcher'=>'Kigeuzi kinachoelea','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Kitufe kidogo kwenye kona ya kila ukurasa, kwenye mada yoyote, bila kusanidi.','Where'=>'Ambapo','Off'=>'Imezimwa','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Pembe ya chini, upande wa mwisho','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Pembe ya chini, upande wa mwanzo','Top corner, end side'=>'Kona ya juu, upande wa mwisho','Top corner, start side'=>'Pembe ya juu, upande wa kuanzia','Switcher around the content'=>'Kibadilishaji karibu na maudhui','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ongeza kifaa cha kubadilishia kwenye kila chapisho na ukurasa','Before the content'=>'Kabla ya maudhui','After the content'=>'Baada ya maudhui','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Njia zingine za kuongeza kibadilishaji','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Kihariri cha vizuizi na kihariri cha tovuti: kizuizi cha "Kibadilisha lugha", chenye miundo mitano.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: kipengele cha "Language switcher".','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Menyu: Muonekano → Menyu → Sanduku la “Kibadilisha lugha”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Sehemu za kando: wijeti ya “Kibadilishaji lugha”.','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Popote pengine, nambari fupi:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor na Bricks: Wijeti ya “Language switcher” katika kila kijenzi.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Wijeti za Elementor na Bricks ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Hifadhi','(Pro)'=>'(Pro)','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Folda moja kwa kila lugha: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Kikoa kimoja kwa kila lugha: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Kikoa tofauti kwa kila lugha: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Kigezo cha hoja: example.com/?lang=de (tovuti za zamani)','Category'=>'Kategoria','Tag'=>'Lebo','Product'=>'Bidhaa','Product category'=>'Kitengo cha bidhaa','Product tag'=>'Lebo ya bidhaa','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Imesemohifadhiwa. Anwani zako za lugha zimebadilishwa kama inavyoonyeshwa hapa chini.','Language in the address'=>'Lugha katika anwani','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Jinsi wageni na injini za utafutaji zinavyofikia kila lugha','Address word for %s'=>'Neno la anwani la %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Lugha chaguo-msingi haina neno katika anwani zake.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Kikoa cha %s (si lazima)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Elekeza kikoa kwenye tovuti hii kwanza. Lugha isiyo na kikoa hutumia folda kwenye kikoa chako kikuu.','Where each language lives now'=>'Mahali ambapo kila lugha inaishi sasa','Translated address words'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Anwani za kurasa na machapisho zinatokana na vichwa vyao vilivyotafsiriwa. Hapa unatafsiri maneno yaliyowekwa, kwa hiyo /de/kategorie/ inachukua nafasi ya /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (sasa "%2$s")','Search engines and visitors'=>'Injini za utafutaji na wageni','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Wape wageni lugha yao kupitia bendera ndogo (si wakati wote kuelekezwa kwingine)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Ficha kurasa ambazo hazijatafsiriwa kutoka kwa injini za utafutaji (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Tafsiri ambayo bado ina maandishi asilia huwekwa nje ya matokeo ya utafutaji hadi itafsiriwe.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly inaongeza viungo vya hreflang (vyenye x-default), lugha ya ukurasa na mwelekeo, na kila lugha kwenye ramani ya tovuti yako:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Inafanya kazi pamoja na: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Kila neno la anwani lina herufi ndogo 2 hadi 12, nambari au vistari.','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ongeza lugha ya pili chini ya Tranzly katika menyu ya msimamizi, na kiteuzi kitaonekana hapa.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: bendera ni nchi, sio lugha.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Kile wasomaji wa skrini wanavyotangaza, kwa mfano "Chagua lugha".','Colours'=>'Rangi','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji cha lugha','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Viungo vya ukurasa huu katika kila lugha ya tovuti. Haionyeshi chochote hadi lugha mbili au zaidi ziorodheshwe.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Lugha','block keywordswitcher'=>'kichochezi','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Inaruhusu wageni kusoma ukurasa huu kwa lugha yako nyingine: orodha, vitufe vya vidonge, vitufe vya kawaida, menyu ya kuteremka au misimbo ya lugha, ikiwa na bendera za hiari.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'yenye lugha nyingi']];